;PHOSPHATE ION (PO4): PRESENT IN CRYSTALLIZATION BUFFER AND
 BOUND NEARBY CATALYTIC SITE OF THE PHOSPHODIESTERASE
IODINE ION (IOD): PRESENT IN CRYSTALLIZATION BUFFER AND
