ZINC ION (ZN): PRESUMED FROM THE CATALYTIC MECHANISM AND
 CONFIRMED BY ANOMALOUS SIGNAL
MANNOSE (MAN): GLYCOSYLATION
THIOCYANATE (SCN): PRESENT IN CRYSTALLIZATION BUFFER
